  "source_limits": [
    "No source sign, space, punctuation or tag changed in this pass. Current strict replay remains 11 rows, 254 selected slots, 253 known emitted letters, zero CH and one unknown slot; the latter has unknown physical length. Two actual written questions remain distinct from the R10 mask. This is working coverage, not a new decipherment or externally confirmed solve.",
