    "All six language proposals remain explicit: DNESNY→DNESNI; ROZEPSA NA→ROZEPSANO (join and A→O); DO JE TI→CO JE TI; VAZ NEJSI→VAZNEJSI (word join only); HOROBA→CHOROBA (added C); TISI?ERO→TISICERO (unknown→C). No CH/roof key assignment, silent spelling correction or recovered mask claimed. MILENKO and PEPOUSE remain labeled address/signature-like forms without identifying historical people.",
    "Both complete fresh Picture/Address frames and all margins inspected, followed by eleven enlarged row contexts and four detail contexts. Anonymous GET200 bytes match both pinned hashes without redirects. No extra continuous cipher run identified on the visible Address face, a bounded negative. Date-like writing was viewed only to retain its separation from cipher text: old day/month alternatives remain unverified, with no chronological conclusion.",
    "Both original first_raw/first_record and blind_raw/blind_record schemas remain unchanged. Twenty-two native strict rows replay directly, and eight inline canonical record identities are recorded; the metadata-only frozen wrappers are not recast as whole raw-file bytes. Original raw/strict FILE bytes were not reread. Initial reconciliation, source-only freeze protocol, checkpoint fingerprints and whole QA16 remain unchanged.",
    "QA16 retains zero mechanical/schema errors, two confirmed other-card frozen SECOND 311 source-tag defects and five global source-scope findings, one concerning this card. The two source-question observations here are not the wrong 311 tags. Historical all-eight checkpoints and both-raw-before-own-replay barriers do not establish independent source accuracy.",
    "Czech and English editions cover all eleven rows; only editorial paragraph breaks change their wording layout. Strict source text, all prior exact alternatives, provisional boundaries, ordinary inscriptions and physical-count limits remain. Same-root key/language-visible nonblind comparison, without external confirmation of 314. Eugen Antal reviewed 320/321 only; other candidates and submitted register unchanged."
